<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals committee to vote on millet quota.</title>
<headline>EU cereals committee to vote on millet quota.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will vote on a proposal on Thursday to allow an additional import quota of about 1,000 tonnes of millet, an EU official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The additonal quota is required under the Article 24/6 GATT (General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade) arrangement covering Austria's entry to the EU,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The vote was postponed after the item was discussed and approved by the EU cereals experts group last week.</p>
<p>- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
</text>
